# Checksums for the test CEL files, after decompression.
#
# Source: GEO series GSE224950 (platform GPL33111, Axiom_UKB_WCSG), deposited by
# the Powell lab at the Garvan Institute for Neavin et al. 2023 (PMID 37296104).
# This is the full series: all twenty hiPSC lines. Twenty is the Axiom manual's
# minimum batch size for SNP-specific-prior clustering, so this set exercises the
# Best Practices QC/genotyping front-end (Dish QC, call-rate QC, plate QC), not
# just the plumbing.
#
# Per-sample sex is not in the GEO metadata; it is determined by APT's
# computed_gender at run time and cross-checked. The original four-line subset
# was 166/180N (female) and IST3323/MBE0953 (male).
#
# GEO serves these gzipped and replaces supplementary files in place without
# changing the accession, so these are checksums of what GEO served on
# 2026-09-20 rather than anything the depositors or NCBI publish. A mismatch
# means the deposit has changed, not necessarily that the download is corrupt.
# (The original four were re-fetched here and matched their 2026-09-18 values.)
